        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write about a museum, monument or concert you have visited: what it was and what you thought.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Recommend aloud a film, a book and a place to visit, saying why."
